    {
      "id": 56,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "VRAM headroom (dedicated)",
      "description": "Per-GPU dedicated-VRAM headroom = (card total - 3 GB desktop reserve) - VRAM used, one series per GPU. Uses each card's real nvidia_gpu_memory_total_mib so it stays correct across a mixed-size multi-GPU rig (e.g. 32 GB 5090 + 24 GB 3090) instead of hardcoding the primary card's size. When a series trends toward the 0 line the NVIDIA driver is about to spill that card's VRAM into system RAM (the WDDM desktop freeze). The Windows shared-memory spill counter itself isn't in Prometheus yet (windows_exporter has no GPU collector) — a future exporter task.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "dark-orange",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 4294967296
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "((nvidia_gpu_memory_total_mib - 3072) * 1048576) - (nvidia_gpu_memory_used_mib * 1048576)",
          "legendFormat": "GPU {{gpu}} headroom",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Detected VRAM pool",
      "description": "Total GPU VRAM across all cards (sum of nvidia_gpu_memory_total_mib). This is the number the dispatcher's gpu_vram_total_gb=\"auto\" budget guard derives.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decgbytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(nvidia_gpu_memory_total_mib) / 1024",
          "legendFormat": "VRAM pool",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Render VRAM gate — free (render GPU)",
      "description": "Free VRAM on the render/display GPU (pipeline_gpu_index=0, the 5090) right now. Below media_render_min_free_vram_gb (default 25 GB → red) the media dispatch gate DEFERS video renders so a ~24 GB Wan render can't oversubscribe the card and spill WDDM into system RAM (the desktop freeze). Green (≥25 GB) → a render may proceed. Source: services/render_vram.py + the media_infra_health VRAM preflight (#2394). Video staying quiet during active desktop use is EXPECTED here until the VRAM-reclaim + idle-WSL-reset follow-up lands. If you retune pipeline_gpu_index, update the gpu filter in this query.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decgbytes",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(nvidia_gpu_memory_total_mib{gpu=\"0\"} - nvidia_gpu_memory_used_mib{gpu=\"0\"}) / 1024",
          "legendFormat": "free",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
